CM_ "custom-pdm status messages (firmware NUM_TX_MSGS 38, msg n = base ID + 2 + n, Intel byte order, 8 bytes). Generated by ui/tools/DbcGen and the /pdm Export DBC button from the same code (ui/dingoConfig/domain/CustomPdm/DbcExport.cs): do not edit. Output and input signals also carry their PDM-wide name (outputs 1-24, inputs 1-27 as on the /pdm page) in the attribute PdmName and in their comment.";
CM_ BU_ B "custom-pdm board B, base ID 0x580";
CM_ BO_ 1410 "B msg 0: always sent";
